# ===== Unreal Engine (Blueprint project) =====
# Regenerable / machine-local folders — never commit these.
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Visual Studio / Rider / editor files (safe to regenerate)
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ===== What we DO keep =====
#   Config/        (project + editor settings)
#   Content/       (your .uasset / .umap game data — tracked via Git LFS)
#   Lingering_Wars.uproject
#   Source/        (if you ever add C++)
#   Plugins/*/     (plugin source & content, minus their Binaries/Intermediate above)
